%% Current process/system topology and control/data collaboration.
%% Arrows do not describe Go imports; see consolidation/03-target-architecture.md#code-dependency-go-imports.
flowchart TB
    Admin[Engineer / Core UI]
    Core[AR-IMMS Core]
    Mock[Go Mock Core / isolated testbed]
    OpAMPServer[Go OpAMP Server adapter]
    NATS[NATS JetStream]
    Gateway[OTLP Gateway]

    Admin --> Core
    Core <-->|Versioned Core contract| OpAMPServer
    Mock <-->|Same contract in tests| OpAMPServer
    OpAMPServer <-->|Native authenticated OpAMP| Supervisor
    Core <-->|Enrollment and supported APIs| Agent
    Core <-->|Authorized operations contract| Operations
    Operations <-->|Authenticated request/result path| NATS

    subgraph Host[Windows / Linux host]
      CLI[agentctl]
      Agent[Agent Service / Application Host]
      Identity[Identity]
      Inventory[Inventory providers]
      Monitoring[Monitoring profiles]
      Configuration[Configuration and desired state]
      Runtime[Runtime provisioning / recovery]
      Health[Health and reporting]
      Operations[Operations]
      SQLite[(SQLite context repositories)]
      Docker[Docker API]
      Observer[OTel Observer]
      Creator[OTel Receiver Creator]
      Receivers[OTel receivers]
      Supervisor[OTel OpAMP Supervisor]
      LegacyOwner[Legacy Agent Collector owner]
      Collector[OTel Collector]

      CLI --> Agent
      Agent --> Identity
      Agent --> Inventory
      Agent --> Monitoring
      Agent --> Configuration
      Agent --> Runtime
      Agent --> Health
      Agent --> Operations
      Docker --> Inventory
      Inventory -->|Observed evidence| Monitoring
      Monitoring -->|Profile recommendation| Configuration
      Configuration -->|Validated candidate / desired state| Runtime
      Runtime -->|New installs require Supervisor endpoint; existing installs migrate explicitly| Supervisor
      Runtime -.->|Explicit legacy selection or rollback; mutually exclusive owner| LegacyOwner
      Supervisor --> Collector
      LegacyOwner -.-> Collector
      Docker --> Observer
      Observer --> Creator
      Creator --> Receivers
      Collector --> Receivers
      Identity <--> SQLite
      Inventory <--> SQLite
      Monitoring <--> SQLite
      Configuration <--> SQLite
      Runtime <--> SQLite
      Health -.->|Evidence snapshots| Agent
    end

    Receivers --> Gateway
